        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hi!\r\n\r\nYes, only supporting split/join arguments under cursor [is by design](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1fdbb864e2015eb6f501394d593630f825154385/doc/mini-splitjoin.txt#L10). This is mostly because finding next/previous brackets is not trivial and is already possible [with 'mini.ai'](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1fdbb864e2015eb6f501394d593630f825154385/doc/mini-ai.txt#L133) (with default or compatible `search_method`).\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
